ent-PlaqueAtmos = atmos 斑塊生成器 | atmos plaque spawner
    .desc = { ent-MarkerBase.desc }
    .suffix = Spawner
ent-PlaqueAtmosFEA = FEA 大氣部門紀念牌匾 | FEA Atmospherics Division plaque
    .desc = 這塊紀念牌旨在紀念 Atmos FEA 部門的覆滅。謹以此紀念所有在其手中喪生、渾身焦黑、神志恍惚且虛弱不堪的男子。 | This plaque commemorates the fall of the Atmos FEA division. For all the charred, dizzy, and brittle men who have died in its hands.
ent-PlaqueAtmosLINDA = LINDA 大氣部門 紀念牌匾 | LINDA Atmospherics Division plaque
    .desc = 這塊紀念牌旨在紀念「Atmos LINDA」師團的覆滅。謹以此紀念所有在該師團手中喪生、渾身焦黑、神智恍惚且虛弱不堪的士兵。 | This plaque commemorates the fall of the Atmos LINDA division. For all the charred, dizzy, and brittle men who have died in its hands.
ent-PlaqueAtmosZAS = ZAS 大氣部門紀念牌匾 | ZAS Atmospherics Division plaque
    .desc = 這塊紀念牌旨在紀念「Atmos ZAS」師團的覆滅。謹以此紀念所有在其手中喪生、渾身焦黑、暈眩不已且虛弱不堪的士兵。 | This plaque commemorates the fall of the Atmos ZAS division. For all the charred, dizzy, and brittle men who have died in its hands.
ent-PlaqueAtmosZUM = ZUM 大氣部門紀念牌 | ZUM Atmospherics Division plaque
    .desc = 這塊紀念牌旨在紀念 Atmos ZUM 部門的崛起。願他們能繼承 Atmos ZAS、LINDA 及 FEA 部門所留下的火炬。 | This plaque commemorates the rise of the Atmos ZUM division. May they carry the torch that the Atmos ZAS, LINDA and FEA divisions left behind.
